<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung Elec 1996 net, turnover down.</title>
<headline>Samsung Elec 1996 net, turnover down.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung Electronics Co posted a provisional net profit of 164.16 billion won in calendar 1996, down from earnings of 2.51 trillion won a year earlier, a company official said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The official said its turnover fell to a provisional 15.87 trillion won in 1996 from 16.19 trillion won a year earlier.</p>
<p>The official declined to give more details and said detailed financial figures would be announced later.</p>
<p>Samsung, flagship unit of the Samsung Group, is the world's largest supplier of dynamic random access memory (DRAM) chips.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
